{"title": "Stuffed Bear", "pageid": 11245, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stuffed_Bear", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items", "Stuffed Animals"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Big)\" title=\"Stuffed Bear (Big)\">Stuffed Bear (Big)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png/300px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stuffed Bear image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png/300px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Stuffed Bear</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous#Clutter\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> Item found in various locations in the world.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A knitted toy bear stuffed with soft fur.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 2 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  2  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>A unique version, named <a href=\"/wiki/Clive\" title=\"Clive\">Clive</a> can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Campsite</a> if <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> is recruited as a <a href=\"/wiki/Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Companion\">Companion</a>.</li>\n<li>An <a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Faded)\" title=\"Stuffed Bear (Faded)\">alternate textured version</a> can also be found in various locations:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>:\n<ul><li>On rare occasions, looted from a <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Brawler\" title=\"Goblin Brawler\">Goblin Brawler</a> after the Emerald Grove Gate fight</li>\n<li>Dropped by <a href=\"/wiki/Gruz\" title=\"Gruz\">Sharp-Eye Gruz</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a></li>\n<li>On a Dead Goblin Raider near the <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_Ox\" title=\"Frightened Ox\">Frightened Ox</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-116&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;602</span></li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Container)\" title=\"Stuffed Bear (Container)\">Stuffed Bear Container</a> can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Sunlit_Wetlands\" title=\"Sunlit Wetlands\">Sunlit Wetlands</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;81&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;318</span></li>\n<li>Sold by <a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\">Mol</a> after defeating the goblins and talking to <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a>, but before the celebration at camp with the tieflings at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;187&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-474</span></li>\n<li>In the southern part of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Festering_Cove\" title=\"The Festering Cove\">The Festering Cove</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>:\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;137&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;66</span></li>\n<li>In a bird's nest in the rafters of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-201&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-8</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>:\n<ul><li>In the garden south of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li>\n<li>In a crate in the <a href=\"/wiki/Requisitioned_Barn\" title=\"Requisitioned Barn\">Requisitioned Barn</a></li>\n<li>Next to <a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\">Popper</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlike the others, the <a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Faded)\" title=\"Stuffed Bear (Faded)\">Stuffed Bear</a> looted from a <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Brawler\" title=\"Goblin Brawler\">Goblin Brawler</a> appears worn and patched up, and the description differs slightly: <br><i>”This bear - oft-torn and repaired - seems one good squeeze away from crumbling into mouldered stuffing and threadbare patchwork”.</i></li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Faded)\" title=\"Stuffed Bear (Faded)\">Stuffed Bear (Faded)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fuzzy\" title=\"Fuzzy\">Fuzzy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lukasz\" title=\"Lukasz\">Lukasz</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Inspect Window view.</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 292px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 290px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stuffed_Bear_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Stuffed_Bear_Model.png/435px-Stuffed_Bear_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Stuffed_Bear_Model.png/652px-Stuffed_Bear_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/cf/Stuffed_Bear_Model.png 2x\"><img alt=\"A brown Stuffed Bear.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Stuffed_Bear_Model.png/435px-Stuffed_Bear_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"290\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Stuffed_Bear_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 417.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 415.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Exploding_Bear_Crate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Exploding_Bear_Crate.png/623px-Exploding_Bear_Crate.png.webp, /w/images/1/1a/Exploding_Bear_Crate.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"A create of exploding Stuffed Bears.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Exploding_Bear_Crate.png/623px-Exploding_Bear_Crate.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"416\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Exploding_Bear_Crate.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1049/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12592/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5515/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1741/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 691138/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.170      1 -total\n 96.46%   28.137      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 24.66%    7.193      4 Template:Icon_text\n 22.87%    6.670      1 Template:Main_only\n 20.01%    5.836      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.32%    5.635      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 17.49%    5.101      8 Template:Trim\n 13.14%    3.833      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.50%    2.772      3 Template:Main_namesp